  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "B型企業與社會影響力評估",
    "sub_ename": "B CORP. AND THE ASSESSMENT OF SOCIAL IMPACT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是想帶引學生了解B型企業，在永續議題的因應上所具有的透明性與可衡量性的特質，進而透過社會影響力評估方法的介紹，導引學生學會如何將企業對社會的正面影響力，透過數量化的方式，來加以評估。",
    "describe_eh": "The main goal of this course is to introduce students to the transparency and measurability characteristics that B-type enterprises possess in response to sustainability issues. Through the introduction of social impact assessment methods, students will learn how to evaluate a company's positive social impact in a quantitative method.",
